<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>ConfigMap on 我的空间</title><link>https://chenjinxin.cn/tags/configmap/</link><description>Recent content in ConfigMap on 我的空间</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:11:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://chenjinxin.cn/tags/configmap/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>CKAD 常用资源：ConfigMap</title><link>https://chenjinxin.cn/p/ckad-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90configmap/</link><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:11:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://chenjinxin.cn/p/ckad-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90configmap/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;code>ConfigMap&lt;/code> 保存非敏感配置。CKAD 常考创建 ConfigMap，并让 Pod 通过环境变量或文件挂载使用。&lt;/p>
